  "text": "### Escalation & Exception Handling  \n**If Proposed Decision Conflicts with Risk Appetite:**\n1. Risk team flags the issue\n2. Business unit provides rationale (why necessary)\n3. Executive committee reviews (CRO, CFO, CEO)\n4. Board Risk Committee notified (if significant)\n5. Documented decision and justification recorded  \n---",
